    {
      "id": "44c5b6fbfbe8-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Which of the following statements is correct? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following statements is correct?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "The net magnetic flux through any closed surface is zero. &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2368; &#2348;&#2306;&#2342; &#2360;&#2340;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375; &#2358;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361; &#2358;&#2370;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">The net magnetic flux through any closed surface is zero.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2368; &#2348;&#2306;&#2342; &#2360;&#2340;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375; &#2358;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361; &#2358;&#2370;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Magnetic flux is a vector quantity. &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2342;&#2367;&#2358; &#2311;&#2325;&#2366;&#2312; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Magnetic flux is a vector quantity.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2342;&#2367;&#2358; &#2311;&#2325;&#2366;&#2312; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Earth's magnetic poles coincide with the geographic poles. &#2346;&#2371;&#2341;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2343;&#2381;&#2352;&#2369;&#2357; &#2349;&#2380;&#2327;&#2379;&#2354;&#2367;&#2325; &#2343;&#2381;&#2352;&#2369;&#2357;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2350;&#2375;&#2354; &#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Earth's magnetic poles coincide with the geographic poles.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2371;&#2341;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2343;&#2381;&#2352;&#2369;&#2357; &#2349;&#2380;&#2327;&#2379;&#2354;&#2367;&#2325; &#2343;&#2381;&#2352;&#2369;&#2357;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2350;&#2375;&#2354; &#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Two magnetic field lines may intersect. &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2352;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Two magnetic field lines may intersect.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2352;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><b>Flux of magnetic field Through a closed surface is equal to zero</b> because Magnetic field lines are close curves, they don't have any beginning or end.</p>",
