      "question": "The induced current is the highest when the direction of motion of the coil is: &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2340;&#2348; &#2313;&#2330;&#2381;&#2330;&#2340;&#2350; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348; &#2325;&#2369;&#2306;&#2337;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2367;&#2358;&#2366; ______",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The induced current is the highest when the direction of motion of the coil is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2340;&#2348; &#2313;&#2330;&#2381;&#2330;&#2340;&#2350; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348; &#2325;&#2369;&#2306;&#2337;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2367;&#2358;&#2366; ______</p></span>",
