          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">not at right angles to the magnetic field</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
