          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">at right angles to the electricity</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "at right angles to the electric source &#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">at right angles to the electric source</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "at right angles to the magnetic field &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">at right angles to the magnetic field</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
