      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which device is used to measure the current flow using needle deflection caused by a magnetic field force acting upon a current-carrying wire?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2354;&#2375; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2352;&#2340; &#2330;&#2369;&#2306;&#2348;&#2325;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2348;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2360;&#2369;&#2312; &#2325;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2346;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2325;&#2375; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361; &#2325;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2313;&#2346;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
